=== PHAN TICH CHI TIET CHUONG TRINH BMC-05-UNSAFE-REVERSE-SCAN (TU BO SUNG) ===

1. BOI CANH VA DINH NGHIA CHUONG TRINH BMC-05:
   - Module: Inventory (Catalog sach)
   - Muc dich: Thao tac duyet nguoc mang catalog (reverse scan)
   - Bieu thuc truy cap trong ma C bi loi:
       for (int i = 0; i < ARRAY_SIZE; i++) {
           int index = ARRAY_SIZE - i; // LOI: tai i = 0, index = ARRAY_SIZE = 10
           printf("%d", catalog[index].id);
       }
   - Lap trinh vien quen rang mang C co chi so danh tu 0 den ARRAY_SIZE - 1.
   - Dung phai la: index = ARRAY_SIZE - 1 - i.

2. KET QUA PHAT HIEN CUA DONG CO BMC (Z3):
   - Ket qua: UNSAFE
   - Buoc unwind vi pham: i = 0 (vi pham ngay tai buoc dau tien!)
   - Nhan chung (witness): {'unwind_step_i': 0, 'index_accessed': 10}
   - Giai thich: Tai buoc i=0, index_accessed = 10 khong thoa man rang buoc 0 <= index < 10.

3. DOI CHIEU RUNTIME THUC TE (C + ADDRESSSANITIZER):
   - Lenh chay: ./c/array_access.exe reverse_scan
   - Ket qua runtime:
     ==5678==ERROR: AddressSanitizer: stack-buffer-overflow on address 0x0028fe28
     READ of size 4 at 0x0028fe28 thread T0 (index 10 outside [0, 10))
     SUMMARY: AddressSanitizer: stack-buffer-overflow in reverse_scan
   - Chuong trinh C bi dung ngay lap tuc tai lan lap dau tien i=0, exit code = 1.
   - Ket qua kiem chung tinh cua BMC va ket qua chay dong cua ASan khop nhau 100%.
